Error [E0003]: the compile-time prefix `$` is retired
  --> tests/ui/comptime_prefix_dollar_retired.jet:3:11
    |
  3 |     print($old)
    |           ^
 Why: D-ONCE-AT1=D gives `@` one prefix mark for compile-time names and fact reads; infix `@` package refs stay unchanged
 Fix: write `@name`, `@if <condition> { … }`, or `T.@layout`
